ation + IPayment types +\n  ContractRegistryCoston2 (hardcoded Coston2 addrs: FtsoV2 + FdcVerification)\n- forge build: Compiler run successful! (3 contracts, solc 0.8.25)\n- src/relayer/fdc.js: preparePaymentRequest + submitToFdcHub + pollForProof\n- src/relayer/index.js: XRPL WebSocket watcher → FDC → settle() on Coston2\n- src/cockpit/server.js: SSE dashboard (FTSO ticks, settlement events, stats)\n- src/heartbeat/index.js: 10min heartbeat — real XRPL → FDC → settle loop\n\nFDC spike gate cleared:\n  XRPL tx 60C7E957... → FdcHub block 32560223 → DA proof 3 elements VALID","tree":{"sha":"c3c2411c5324d90b5f1d25cd95dea78cf8f797aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luongs3/flare-firegate/git/trees/c3c2411c5324d90b5f1d25cd95dea78cf8f797aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luongs3/flare-firegate/git/commits/033edb52370fd195a97b5eedcaba5043e66a9f8e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luongs3/flare-firegate/commits/033edb52370fd195a97b5eedcaba5043e66a9f8e","html_url":"https://github.com/luongs3/flare-firegate/commit/033edb52370fd195a97b5eedcaba5043e66a9f8e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luongs3/flare-firegate/commits/033edb52370fd195a97b5eedcaba5043e66a9f8e/comments","author":{"login":"luongs3","id":12150725,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTUwNzI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12150725?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luongs3","html_url":"https://github.com/luongs3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luongs3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luongs3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luongs3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luongs3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luongs3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luongs3/orgs","repo